{"unit_id":"ai-shushu__dsh-quota-meter#card-zh","repo":"ai-shushu/dsh-quota-meter","commit":"66bb2bee4a48458dbae30452999b37e31640963d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Quota Meter Shushu 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话额度监控插件。它在输入框上方显示会话花费与剩余额度，并按模型调用返回的真实 token 用量、缓存命中情况和配置的 (provider, model) 价目表计算费用。用户可为每个会话设置预算、编辑模型单价和峰谷时段；达到预算后，插件会拦截后续模型步骤并提示用户。额度和花费会按会话写入本地存储，子代理的用量会汇总到父会话。价格表无需 API Key；插件也提供按需检查 DeepSeek 官方价格和远端版本的功能。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:731-790","lib/client.js:1167-1184","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"ai-shushu__dsh-quota-meter#card-en","repo":"ai-shushu/dsh-quota-meter","commit":"66bb2bee4a48458dbae30452999b37e31640963d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Quota Meter Shushu tracks token costs per DSH web session. The input bar shows spending and remaining budget; users edit model rates and peak prices. At the cap, new agent steps are blocked. Ledgers persist locally, with child usage merged into the parent. Optional price sync needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:731-790","lib/client.js:1167-1184","cordis.patch.yml:1-12"]}
